# Names past ASCII where a theme shows capitals: the colour schemes by name and
# a notification in Albanian, Greek and Cyrillic.
start shell
drawn
ipc settings theme/look; pause 2.6; shot schemes
ipc close; pause 0.8
ipc notify "Rosé Pine, një çelës për këtë" "Çajupi, Ελληνικά, Жанна" normal "Çelësat"; pause 2; shot notification
stop
